 "description": "25x8 remote-latching button: a SWCH toggled ON by a WIFI(set) through PSCN above and OFF by a WIFI(reset) through NSCN below; when latched it passes an input WIFI's spark down a PSCN/NSCN/METL chain to an output WIFI. Stacked 3x = the source's fill/flow/drain water panel.",
